OL,3,GNEWSACall to remove clothes banks over
OL,4,A'waste mountain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FClothes banks in a suburb in Derby have
OL,7,Fbeen described as a "Mount Everest of
OL,8,Fhousehold waste" as donations pile up.
OL,10,FResidents say they are concerned about
OL,11,Fthe amount of recycling left outside a
OL,12,Frow of charity donation banks that are
OL,13,Fon private land and part of the Sinfin
OL,14,FShopping Centre in Derby.
OL,16,FBarbara Hall, who works for the Marie
OL,17,FCurie charity shop nearby, said Sinfin
OL,18,Fhad started to turn into "Sin-bin"
OL,19,Fbecause of the problem.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
