OL,3,GNEWSACall to remove clothes banks over
OL,4,A'waste mountain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsda, which manages the clothing banks,
OL,7,Fsaid it was actively reviewing their
OL,8,Fuse but no decision had been made
OL,9,Fregarding their removal.
